{"id":"2fa56b15b1b02b78","group":"28","path":"28/28-lem-reed-solomon-distance.md","title":"Exact Reed Solomon Distance","display":"lem-reed-solomon-distance — Exact Reed Solomon Distance","type":"lemma","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-lem-reed-solomon-distance","aliases":["28-lem-reed-solomon-distance"],"type":"lemma","display":"lem-reed-solomon-distance — Exact Reed Solomon Distance","depends_on":["[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]","[[28-df-reed-solomon-code]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Lemma 19.11 (with a locally proved sharpening)","source_printed_pages":"383","source_pdf_pages":"409","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-lem-reed-solomon-distance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-lem-reed-solomon-distance</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-reed-solomon-distance — Exact Reed Solomon Distance"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fb76a370ebde152b\" href=\"?note=fb76a370ebde152b\" title=\"28-df-error-correcting-code\">28-df-error-correcting-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d15e66fdc836d19\" href=\"?note=5d15e66fdc836d19\" title=\"28-df-reed-solomon-code\">28-df-reed-solomon-code</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Lemma 19.11 (with a locally proved sharpening)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"383"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"409"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,n,m,\\alpha,\\operatorname{RS}_{F,n,\\alpha}\">\\(F,n,m,\\alpha,\\operatorname{RS}_{F,n,\\alpha}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_c\">\\(P_c\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d15e66fdc836d19\" href=\"?note=5d15e66fdc836d19\" title=\"28-df-reed-solomon-code\">28-df-reed-solomon-code</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_m^F\">\\(\\Delta_m^F\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{F,F}\">\\(\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{F,F}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fb76a370ebde152b\" href=\"?note=fb76a370ebde152b\" title=\"28-df-error-correcting-code\">28-df-error-correcting-code</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\min_{\\substack{c,d\\in F^n\\\\c\\ne d}}\\Delta_m^F\\!\\left(\\operatorname{RS}_{F,n,\\alpha}(c),\\operatorname{RS}_{F,n,\\alpha}(d)\\right)=1-\\frac{n-1}{m}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\min_{\\substack{c,d\\in F^n\\\\c\\ne d}}\\Delta_m^F\\!\\left(\\operatorname{RS}_{F,n,\\alpha}(c),\\operatorname{RS}_{F,n,\\alpha}(d)\\right)=1-\\frac{n-1}{m}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{F,F}\\!\\left(\\operatorname{RS}_{F,n,\\alpha};1-\\frac{n-1}{m}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{F,F}\\!\\left(\\operatorname{RS}_{F,n,\\alpha};1-\\frac{n-1}{m}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{F,F}\\!\\left(\\operatorname{RS}_{F,n,\\alpha};1-\\frac{n}{m}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{F,F}\\!\\left(\\operatorname{RS}_{F,n,\\alpha};1-\\frac{n}{m}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Lemma 19.11（印刷383页/PDF409页）只陈述较松的距离下界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1-n/m\">\\(1-n/m\\)</span>。本节点保留该下界，并以本地完整证明给出精确最小距离 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1-(n-1)/m\">\\(1-(n-1)/m\\)</span>；没有把加强式冒充原书字面陈述。</p>\n<p>下界证明：不同系数向量之差给出非零次数至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n-1\">\\(n-1\\)</span> 的多项式，因此在不同的求值点中至多有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n-1\">\\(n-1\\)</span> 个根。根数界可由域上的除法算法逐次剥去因子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X-\\alpha_i\">\\(X-\\alpha_i\\)</span> 证明：每个不同根提供一个因子，非零多项式总次数至少为因子数。故输出至少在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m-n+1\">\\(m-n+1\\)</span> 个坐标不同。</p>\n<p>达到下界：取零多项式和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(X)=\\prod_{i=1}^{n-1}(X-\\alpha_i)\">\\(Q(X)=\\prod_{i=1}^{n-1}(X-\\alpha_i)\\)</span>。后者非零、次数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n-1\">\\(n-1\\)</span>，恰在前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n-1\">\\(n-1\\)</span> 个求值点为零，故距离恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(m-n+1)/m\">\\((m-n+1)/m\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=1\">\\(n=1\\)</span> 时空积为一，距离为一，仍满足等式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=m\">\\(n=m\\)</span> 时精确距离为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/m&gt;0\">\\(1/m&gt;0\\)</span>，而原书松界为零。这些边界已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-error-correcting-code","status":"resolved","id":"fb76a370ebde152b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-reed-solomon-code","status":"resolved","id":"5d15e66fdc836d19","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-reed-solomon-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-reed-solomon-code","status":"resolved","id":"5d15e66fdc836d19","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F,n,m,\\alpha,\\operatorname{RS}_{F,n,\\alpha}$、$P_c$ 见 [[28-df-reed-solomon-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-error-correcting-code","status":"resolved","id":"fb76a370ebde152b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Delta_m^F$、$\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{F,F}$ 见 [[28-df-error-correcting-code]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F,n,m,\\alpha,\\operatorname{RS}_{F,n,\\alpha}","display":false},{"tex":"P_c","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_m^F","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{F,F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\min_{\\substack{c,d\\in F^n\\\\c\\ne d}}\\Delta_m^F\\!\\left(\\operatorname{RS}_{F,n,\\alpha}(c),\\operatorname{RS}_{F,n,\\alpha}(d)\\right)=1-\\frac{n-1}{m}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{F,F}\\!\\left(\\operatorname{RS}_{F,n,\\alpha};1-\\frac{n-1}{m}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{F,F}\\!\\left(\\operatorname{RS}_{F,n,\\alpha};1-\\frac{n}{m}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"1-n/m","display":false},{"tex":"1-(n-1)/m","display":false},{"tex":"n-1","display":false},{"tex":"n-1","display":false},{"tex":"X-\\alpha_i","display":false},{"tex":"m-n+1","display":false},{"tex":"Q(X)=\\prod_{i=1}^{n-1}(X-\\alpha_i)","display":false},{"tex":"n-1","display":false},{"tex":"n-1","display":false},{"tex":"(m-n+1)/m","display":false},{"tex":"n=1","display":false},{"tex":"n=m","display":false},{"tex":"1/m>0","display":false}],"bytes":2069,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-246","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第19章：硬度放大与纠错码：[[28-df-circuit-hardness]]、[[28-thm-yao-xor-lemma]]、[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]、[[28-prop-unique-decoding-radius]]、[[28-df-walsh-hadamard-code]]、[[28-thm-walsh-hadamard-self-correction]]、[[28-df-reed-solomon-code]]、[[28-lem-reed-solomon-distance]]、[[28-prop-concatenated-code-distance]]、[[28-thm-binary-johnson-bound]]。"}],"outgoing":["fb76a370ebde152b","5d15e66fdc836d19"]}